---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Redemption Analytics — Digital Infrastructure for Professional Services"
  description="Law firms, medical practices, and financial advisors: we build digital infrastructure you actually own. GA4 native, zero redesign fees, 100% code ownership."
>

<!-- HERO — full-bleed video -->
<section class="hero">
  <video class="hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=""
    src="/hero.mp4">
  </video>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-body">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-left">
        <h1 class="hero-h" id="heroH">
          <span class="w">Stop</span> <span class="w"><span class="chip">renting</span></span><br>
          <span class="w">your</span> <span class="w">digital</span><br>
          <span class="w"><span class="serif-it">presence.</span></span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">Most agencies lease you a website — and when you leave, they keep your data. We build owned digital infrastructure for law firms, medical practices, and financial advisors who are done with landlords.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary">
            Schedule a Consultation
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#comparison" class="btn-ghost">See how we're different ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-right">
        <div class="browser-mock" id="browserMock">
          <div class="browser-bar">
            <div class="b-dots">
              <div class="b-dot"></div><div class="b-dot"></div><div class="b-dot"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="b-url">
              <span class="b-url-dot"></span>
              smithandassociates.com
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="browser-content">
            <div class="mock-hero-strip">
              <div class="mock-h">Smith &amp; Associates</div>
              <div class="mock-sub">Pittsburgh's Premier Personal Injury Law Firm</div>
              <span class="mock-btn">Free Consultation →</span>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-stats">
              <div class="mock-stat"><div class="mock-sn">98</div><div class="mock-sl">Perf Score</div></div>
              <div class="mock-stat"><div class="mock-sn">#1</div><div class="mock-sl">Local Rank</div></div>
              <div class="mock-stat"><div class="mock-sn">GA4</div><div class="mock-sl">Analytics</div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="mock-cards">
              <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-card-label">Ownership</div><div class="mock-card-val">100% Yours</div></div>
              <div class="mock-card"><div class="mock-card-label">Redesign Fee</div><div class="mock-card-val">$0</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-strip">
    <div class="hs-cell">
      <div class="hs-n"><span class="bl" id="hp">0</span>%</div>
      <div class="hs-l">Code Ownership — Yours, Forever</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hs-cell">
      <div class="hs-n">GA<span class="bl">4</span></div>
      <div class="hs-l">Analytics — Zero Vendor Lock-In</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hs-cell">
      <div class="hs-n">$<span class="bl">0</span></div>
      <div class="hs-l">Redesign Fees — Always</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hs-cell">
      <div class="hs-n"><span class="bl">6</span></div>
      <div class="hs-l">Industries — Law · Med · Finance · More</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- TICKER -->
<div class="ticker">
  <div class="tt">
    <span class="ti b">Website as a Service</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">GA4 Native</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">100% Code Ownership</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">HIPAA Compliant</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">ViCall — Zero-Trust Comms</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">Next.js · Astro</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">AI Consulting</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">ADA Compliant</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">No Redesign Fees</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">Pittsburgh, PA</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">Website as a Service</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">GA4 Native</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">100% Code Ownership</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">HIPAA Compliant</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">ViCall — Zero-Trust Comms</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">Next.js · Astro</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">AI Consulting</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">ADA Compliant</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti b">No Redesign Fees</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
    <span class="ti">Pittsburgh, PA</span><span class="ti ts">·</span>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- STATEMENT -->
<section class="stmt">
  <div class="stmt-label sr">The Problem</div>
  <div>
    <blockquote class="stmt-q sr d1">Their "exclusive" analytics dashboard isn't a feature — it's a cage that <mark>slows your site, tanks your rankings,</mark> and ensures your data disappears the moment you try to leave.</blockquote>
    <div class="stmt-cols sr d2">
      <p class="stmt-body">Legacy agencies sell proprietary tracking scripts as premium value. They're not — they're bloated code that poisons your Google rankings and locks your historical data behind a paywall you'll never stop paying. The second you stop, you lose everything.</p>
      <p class="stmt-body">We deploy Google Analytics 4 — the industry gold standard — because it's the right tool for your business, not because it traps you. If we ever part ways, you walk out with 100% of your code, your data, and your history. No asterisks. No hostages.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- COMPARISON -->
<section class="cmp" id="comparison">
  <div class="cmp-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker sr">The Difference</div>
      <h2 class="cmp-title sr d1"><span class="dim">Them</span><br>vs.<br><span class="bl">Us.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="cmp-sub sr d2">The ownership model isn't a radical idea — it's just one most agencies avoid because it means they can't hold you hostage when you want to leave.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cmp-cards sr">
    <div class="cmp-card bad">
      <div class="cmp-card-head">
        <div class="cmp-card-head-dot"></div>
        <span class="cmp-card-head-title">Traditional Agency</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cmp-rows">
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✕</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Website ownership</span><span class="cmp-row-val">None</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✕</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Analytics platform</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Proprietary lock-in</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✕</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Your data when you leave</span><span class="cmp-row-val">They keep it</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✕</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Design templates</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Sold to competitors</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✕</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Page speed &amp; SEO</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Hurt by code bloat</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✕</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Redesign fees</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Every 3–5 years</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✕</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Tech stack control</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Vendor-controlled</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cmp-card good">
      <div class="cmp-card-head">
        <div class="cmp-card-head-dot"></div>
        <span class="cmp-card-head-title">Redemption Analytics</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cmp-rows">
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✓</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Website ownership</span><span class="cmp-row-val">100% Yours</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✓</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Analytics platform</span><span class="cmp-row-val">GA4 Native</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✓</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Your data when you leave</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Full history stays</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✓</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Design templates</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Bespoke only</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✓</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Page speed &amp; SEO</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Zero-bloat stack</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✓</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Redesign fees</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Never</span></div>
        <div class="cmp-row-item"><div class="cmp-row-icon">✓</div><span class="cmp-row-label">Tech stack control</span><span class="cmp-row-val">Next.js / Astro</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STATS -->
<div class="stats">
  <div class="st sr"><div class="st-n"><span id="s1">0</span><span class="dim">%</span></div><div class="st-l">Code<br>Ownership</div><div class="st-bg">Own</div></div>
  <div class="st sr d1"><div class="st-n">GA<span class="dim">4</span></div><div class="st-l">Gold-Standard<br>Analytics</div><div class="st-bg">GA4</div></div>
  <div class="st sr d2"><div class="st-n">$<span class="dim">0</span></div><div class="st-l">Redesign Fees<br>Ever Again</div><div class="st-bg">Free</div></div>
  <div class="st sr d3"><div class="st-n"><span id="s2">0</span></div><div class="st-l">Industries<br>Served</div><div class="st-bg">6×</div></div>
</div>

<!-- SERVICES -->
<section class="svcs" id="services">
  <div class="svcs-head">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker sr">Who We Serve</div>
      <h2 class="display-title sr d1">Built for <span class="serif-it">high-trust</span><br>industries</h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-sub sr d2">Professional services firms need digital infrastructure that earns trust before a single word is read. We build specifically for that pressure.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="bento sr">
    <div class="bc c7 blue">
      <div><div class="bc-num">01</div><div class="bc-title">Legal &amp; Law Firms</div><p class="bc-body">Dominate local search without proprietary lead gen fees. Own your intake pipeline from first impression through consultation — no middlemen skimming your leads.</p><span class="bc-tag">Attorney Marketing</span></div>
      <div class="bc-big">§</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bc c5 dark">
      <div><div class="bc-num">02</div><div class="bc-title">Medical &amp; Health</div><p class="bc-body">HIPAA-compliant infrastructure that connects patients to care — fast, secure, and built to convert before the competition loads.</p><span class="bc-tag">HIPAA Ready</span></div>
      <div class="bc-big">Rx</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bc c4">
      <div><div class="bc-num">03</div><div class="bc-title">Financial Services</div><p class="bc-body">Fiduciary-grade web performance. No conflicts of interest buried in your tech stack.</p><span class="bc-tag">Compliance Aware</span></div>
      <div class="bc-big">$</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bc c4">
      <div><div class="bc-num">04</div><div class="bc-title">Real Estate</div><p class="bc-body">High-speed property showcasing for luxury agents and multifamily portfolios.</p><span class="bc-tag">High Performance</span></div>
      <div class="bc-big">⌂</div>
    </div>
    <div class="bc c4">
      <div><div class="bc-num">05–06</div><div class="bc-title">Non-Profit &amp; Gov</div><p class="bc-body">Mission-first, ADA-ready, audit-proof. Maximum impact per dollar spent.</p><span class="bc-tag">ADA Compliant</span></div>
      <div class="bc-big">⚖</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VICALL -->
<section class="vicall" id="vicall">
  <div class="vicall-inner">
    <div class="vicall-left">
      <div class="vc-label">
        ViCall <span>· Proprietary Product</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="vicall-title sr">The world's most secure<br><span class="serif-it">business communications</span></h2>
      <p class="vicall-body sr d1">ViCall is a private, zero-trust communications platform engineered for professionals who can't afford a breach. No public IP addresses. No data stored at rest. On-device AI detects voice deepfakes in real time — before they reach your ear.</p>
      <div class="vc-features sr d2">
        <div class="vc-feat">
          <div class="vc-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="vc-feat-text">Zero-trust Phantom Network <span>— no public IP, no exposure surface</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="vc-feat">
          <div class="vc-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4M4.22 4.22l2.83 2.83M16.95 16.95l2.83 2.83M1 12h4M19 12h4M4.22 19.78l2.83-2.83M16.95 7.05l2.83-2.83"/></svg></div>
          <div class="vc-feat-text">On-device deepfake detection <span>— AI voice clone verification, locally processed</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="vc-feat">
          <div class="vc-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/></svg></div>
          <div class="vc-feat-text">Biometric caller verification <span>— three-layer authentication on every call</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="vc-feat">
          <div class="vc-feat-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6A19.79 19.79 0 012.12 4.18 2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg></div>
          <div class="vc-feat-text">HIPAA &amp; attorney-client privilege ready <span>— built for regulated industries from day one</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sr d3">
        <span class="vc-pill">
          <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
          Zero-Trust Architecture
        </span>
        <span class="vc-pill">
          <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/><path d="M12 1v4M12 19v4"/></svg>
          On-Device AI
        </span>
        <span class="vc-pill">Early Access</span>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-flex;margin-top:1rem">
          Request Early Access
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- iPhone 15 Pro mockup -->
    <div class="vicall-right sr d2">
      <div class="iphone-scene">
        <div class="iphone">
          <div class="iphone-silent"></div>
          <div class="iphone-vol-up"></div>
          <div class="iphone-vol-dn"></div>
          <div class="iphone-power"></div>
          <div class="iphone-screen">
            <div class="dynamic-island">
              <div class="di-green"></div>
              <span class="di-label">ViCall Secure</span>
            </div>
            <div class="iphone-statusbar">
              <span class="sb-time">9:41</span>
              <div class="sb-icons">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 17 12" style="width:17px;height:12px"><rect x="0" y="8" width="3" height="4" rx=".5" fill="white"/><rect x="4.5" y="5.5" width="3" height="6.5" rx=".5" fill="white"/><rect x="9" y="3" width="3" height="9" rx=".5" fill="white"/><rect x="13.5" y="0" width="3" height="12" rx=".5" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.35)"/></svg>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 16 12" style="width:16px;height:12px;fill:none;stroke:white;stroke-linecap:round"><path d="M1 4.5C4 1.5 12 1.5 15 4.5M3.5 7C5.5 5 10.5 5 12.5 7M6 9.5C7 8.5 9 8.5 10 9.5M8 12h.01" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 25 12" style="width:25px;height:12px"><rect x="0" y="1" width="21" height="10" rx="2.5" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.2" fill="none"/><rect x="22" y="4" width="2.5" height="4" rx="1" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.4)"/><rect x="1.5" y="2.5" width="16" height="7" rx="1.5" fill="white"/></svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="iphone-content">
              <div class="vc-status">
                <div class="vc-status-dot"></div>
                <span class="vc-status-text">Secure · Encrypted</span>
              </div>
              <div class="vc-avatar">RS</div>
              <div class="vc-caller">Richard Sterling</div>
              <div class="vc-role">Senior Partner · Sterling Law Group</div>
              <div class="vc-layers">
                <div class="vc-layer">
                  <div class="vc-layer-dot green"></div>
                  <span class="vc-layer-label">Signal Processing</span>
                  <span class="vc-layer-val ok">Verified</span>
                </div>
                <div class="vc-layer">
                  <div class="vc-layer-dot green"></div>
                  <span class="vc-layer-label">Voice Biometric</span>
                  <span class="vc-layer-val ok">Matched</span>
                </div>
                <div class="vc-layer">
                  <div class="vc-layer-dot amber"></div>
                  <span class="vc-layer-label">Deepfake Detection</span>
                  <span class="vc-layer-val scan">Scanning</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="vc-timer">08 : 42</div>
              <div class="vc-controls">
                <div class="vc-ctrl">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 006 0V4a3 3 0 00-3-3z"/><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 01-14 0v-2M12 19v4M8 23h8"/></svg>
                  <span class="vc-ctrl-label">Mute</span>
                </div>
                <div class="vc-ctrl end">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" style="transform:rotate(135deg)"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 01-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 01-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 014.11 2h3a2 2 0 012 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
                  <span class="vc-ctrl-label">End</span>
                </div>
                <div class="vc-ctrl">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"/><path d="M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 010 7.07M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 010 14.14"/></svg>
                  <span class="vc-ctrl-label">Speaker</span>
                </div>
                <div class="vc-ctrl">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"/></svg>
                  <span class="vc-ctrl-label">Encrypt</span>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="iphone-home"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="phone-badge">
          <div class="pb-top">Threat Level</div>
          <div class="pb-val"><span>None Detected</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="phone-badge2">
          <div class="pb2-top">Encryption</div>
          <div class="pb2-val">E2E <span>Active</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WAAS -->
<section class="waas" id="waas">
  <div class="waas-inner">
    <div class="waas-left">
      <div class="kicker sr">WaaS 2.0</div>
      <h2 class="waas-title sr d1">Complete digital infrastructure,<br><span class="serif-it">managed for you</span></h2>
      <p class="waas-body sr d2">We handle the full complexity of the modern web so you can focus on your practice. Every engagement is senior-led — never handed off to a junior team after kickoff.</p>
      <div class="waas-ctas sr d3">
        <a href="/waas" class="btn-primary" style="display:inline-flex">
          Explore WaaS 2.0
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn-ghost-dark" style="display:inline-flex;margin-left:.75rem">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="feat sr"><div class="fn-box">01</div><div><div class="fn-name">True Asset Ownership</div><p class="fn-body">The competition leases you a website like a landlord. We build you an asset — code, domain, content, all unconditionally yours. Forever, no asterisks.</p></div></div>
      <div class="feat sr d1"><div class="fn-box">02</div><div><div class="fn-name">White Glove Strategy</div><p class="fn-body">No Template #45. Bespoke strategy only — senior consultants handling the technical complexity so you can focus on billable hours, not chasing your web vendor.</p></div></div>
      <div class="feat sr d2"><div class="fn-box">03</div><div><div class="fn-name">Zero-Cost Evolution</div><p class="fn-body">The web evolves fast. We implement design trends and technology updates continuously. No redesign invoices, no scope-change surprises. Your site never rots.</p></div></div>
      <div class="feat sr d3"><div class="fn-box">04</div><div><div class="fn-name">Built for Your Practice</div><p class="fn-body">Tailored to your firm, not a generic professional services template. Every pixel and data touchpoint is customized to your exact requirements.</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROCESS -->
<section class="proc" id="process">
  <div class="proc-header">
    <div>
      <div class="kicker sr">Our Process</div>
      <h2 class="display-title sr d1">How we <span class="serif-it">deliver.</span></h2>
    </div>
    <p class="section-sub sr d2">A proven methodology that gets projects delivered on time, within budget, and aligned with your strategic objectives — without the surprises.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="proc-steps">
    <div class="ps sr"><div class="ps-n">01</div><div class="ps-title">Discovery</div><p class="ps-body">Deep dive into your business, challenges, and goals. We define what success looks like before writing a single line of code — so nothing gets built that shouldn't exist.</p></div>
